<p class=MsoNormal>w<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>         </span>Number to
output.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>fl<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>          </span>Field
width.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Description</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Convert integer to decimal using a format string, and output
to the text file. The format string determines the format the converted number
will take. If the output file is left off, then the standard output is used by
default.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

