<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Convert real to &quot;economy&quot; decimal, and output to
the text file. The economy format is covered in the description for reales. It
is an error if the field width is zero. If the field width does not appear, it
defaults to 1. If the output file is left off, then the standard output is used
by default.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

