the file is not specified, it defaults to the standard output.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Subscript</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>procedure subscript(f: text; ena: boolean);</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>procedure subscript(ena: boolean);</p>

