<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>            </span>Number of
joysticks present.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Description</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Returns the number of joysticks present, which can be 0 to
4. If no file is specified, defaults to the standard output.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Joybutton</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>function joybutton(f: text; h: integer): integer;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>function joybutton(h: integer): integer;</p>

