<p class=MsoNormal>Parameters</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>f<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>           </span>Window file</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Description</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Backs up the cursor by one space, and erases the character
at that position. This procedure is only valid if the font size is fixed, ie.,
all characters the same width as a space. If no file is specified, defaults to
the standard output.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Up</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>procedure up(f: text);</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>procedure up;</p>

