<p class=MsoNormal>f<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>           </span>Window file</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Description</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Moves the cursor up one line. Subtracts the height and line
space of the current font from the cursor Y position in pixels. If no file is
specified, defaults to the standard output.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Down</p>

