<p class=MsoNormal>Description</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Moves the cursor down one line. Adds the height and line
space of the current font to the cursor Y position in pixels. If no file is specified,
defaults to the standard output.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

