<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Causes all further characters to appear in superscript. See
text. This procedure alters the character path upwards and may overwrite text
above the current line. If no file is specified, defaults to the standard
output.</p>

