<p class=MsoNormal>Description</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Causes all further characters to appear in subscript. See
text. This procedure alters the character path downwards and may overwrite text
below the current line. If no file is specified, defaults to the standard
output.</p>

