reset, in characters</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Description</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Removes a tab at the given character position. This is a
no-op if there is not a tab set at that position. If no file is specified,
defaults to the standard output.</p>

