<p class=MsoNormal>Description</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Draws a rectangle between positions 1 and 2, using the
current width, foreground color and mode. If no file is specified, defaults to
the standard output.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Frect</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>procedure frect(f: text; x1, y1, x2, y2: integer);</p>

