style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>(scldpid: integer); { scroll dwn/rgt page }</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>      </span>etsclpos:<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>(sclpid:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> 
</span>integer;<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>{ scroll bar }</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>                 
</span>sclpos:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>integer); { scroll bar
position }</p>

