style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>(edtbid:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> 
</span>integer); { edit box complete }</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>      </span>etnumbox:<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>(numbid:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> 
</span>integer;<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>{ num sel box select }</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>                 
</span>numbsl:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>integer); { num select
value }</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>      </span>etlstbox:<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>(lstbid:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> 
