style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>(drpbid:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> 
</span>integer;<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>{ drop box select }</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>                 
</span>drpbsl:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>integer); { drop box
select }</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>      </span>etdrebox:<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>(drebid:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> 
</span>integer); { drop edit box select }</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>      </span>etsldpos:<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>(sldpid:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> 
</span>integer;<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>{ slider position }</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>              </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>sldpos:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> 
</span>integer); { slider position }</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>      </span>ettabbar:<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>(tabid:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  
</span>integer;<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>{ tab bar }</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>                 
</span>tabsel:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>integer); { tab select }</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>      </span>etup, etdown,
etleft, etright, etleftw, etrightw,</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>      </span><span lang=FR
