<p class=MsoNormal>The general string is written to the text file.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>ps_wrtstrf</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>procedure PS_WrtStrF(var fn: filnum; f: integer; </p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-tab-count:3'>                                    </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>     </span>view s: string);</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>The general string is written to the text file using the
given field.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

