<p class=MsoNormal>procedure PS_WrtEol(var fn: filnum);</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Writes an eoln to the text file.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>ps_rdint</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>procedure PS_RdInt(var fn: filnum; var i: integer);</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Reads an integer from the text file.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>ps_rdchr</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>procedure PS_RdChr(var fn: filnum; var c: char);</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Reads a character from the text file.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>ps_rdreal</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>procedure PS_RdReal(var fn: filnum; var r: real);</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Reads a real from the text file.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>ps_rdeol</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>procedure PS_RdEol(var fn: filnum);</p>

