<p class=MsoNormal>Reads to the next eoln in the text file.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>ps_chkeol</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>function PS_ChkEol(var fn: filnum);</p>

