<p class=MsoNormal>Returns the status of eoln for the text file.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=FR style='mso-ansi-language:FR'>ps_eoffil<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=FR style='mso-ansi-language:FR'>function
PS_EofFil(var fn: filnum);<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=FR style='mso-ansi-language:FR'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Returns the status of eof for the file.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>ps_eoftxt</p>

<p class=MsoNormal>function PS_EofTxt(var fn: filnum);</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Returns the status of eof for the text file.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

