<p class=MsoNormal>General file write. The given byte array is written to the
file. It is an error if the length of the array does not match the buffer
length of the file.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>ps_rdfil</p>

